{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You move in the dark, your echoes follow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They move only when you do. Every step brings you closer to survival or death in this horror FPS game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/a3732c93d45f240ee69a10308f8df651.poster.avif?t=1754820049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/a3732c93d45f240ee69a10308f8df651.webm?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/a3732c93d45f240ee69a10308f8df651.mp4?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an officer on duty, you\u2019re sent to investigate a mysterious emergency call and you find yourself in the middle of nowhere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/965343c0d4c239db64f1041fe4885df5.poster.avif?t=1754820049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/965343c0d4c239db64f1041fe4885df5.webm?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/965343c0d4c239db64f1041fe4885df5.mp4?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what you find is an abandoned graveyard swallowed by shadows... and something is waiting for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart terrifying creatures that move when you move. Conserve ammo, get creative, and use traps to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A forgotten cult. Lost faith. The answers are buried deep in chilling puzzles left behind by those who came before you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health and ammo are scarce. Explore carefully, survival may depend on what you find... and what you don\u2019t.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover long-buried secrets and find out what really happened here: you may end up staying here for something completely different than what you came for</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/bed6eca65078c5ade90f54a7a7e82b08.poster.avif?t=1754820049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/bed6eca65078c5ade90f54a7a7e82b08.webm?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/bed6eca65078c5ade90f54a7a7e82b08.mp4?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you walk into the dark\u2026 and face what stirs in the tall grass?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736440?t=1754820049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/c33d096795a85657f61b73f7832e3e25bc4da781/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754820049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/980e13a5ca3cb646b3564a3fa25280c0e79a4c79/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754820049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/980e13a5ca3cb646b3564a3fa25280c0e79a4c79/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754820049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains frequent scenes of violence involving shooting and killing supernatural creatures. Players will encounter dead bodies of police officers in the environment, including one instance where a body is visibly cut in half. However, the game does not include graphic gore or detailed internal organs.\r\n\r\nThere are no depictions of sexual content, sexual violence, drug or alcohol use, or self-harm."},"demos":[{"appid":3822590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You move in the dark, your echoes follow.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They move only when you do. Every step brings you closer to survival or death in this horror FPS game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/a3732c93d45f240ee69a10308f8df651.poster.avif?t=1754820049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/a3732c93d45f240ee69a10308f8df651.webm?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/a3732c93d45f240ee69a10308f8df651.mp4?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an officer on duty, you\u2019re sent to investigate a mysterious emergency call and you find yourself in the middle of nowhere...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/965343c0d4c239db64f1041fe4885df5.poster.avif?t=1754820049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/965343c0d4c239db64f1041fe4885df5.webm?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/965343c0d4c239db64f1041fe4885df5.mp4?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what you find is an abandoned graveyard swallowed by shadows... and something is waiting for you in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart terrifying creatures that move when you move. Conserve ammo, get creative, and use traps to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A forgotten cult. Lost faith. The answers are buried deep in chilling puzzles left behind by those who came before you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health and ammo are scarce. Explore carefully, survival may depend on what you find... and what you don\u2019t.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover long-buried secrets and find out what really happened here: you may end up staying here for something completely different than what you came for</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/bed6eca65078c5ade90f54a7a7e82b08.poster.avif?t=1754820049\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/bed6eca65078c5ade90f54a7a7e82b08.webm?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/extras/bed6eca65078c5ade90f54a7a7e82b08.mp4?t=1754820049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you walk into the dark\u2026 and face what stirs in the tall grass?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Martin Demeter","Szabolcs T\u00f3th"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/b28b535050ea2c6e17a3a9059162f48e21370111/header.jpg?t=1754820049","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736440/916454330/21096c5dfd4577ccd8a290234edae81b8f850d96/1750430926/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748980957","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736440/916454330/21096c5dfd4577ccd8a290234edae81b8f850d96/1750430926/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748980957","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3736440/916454330/21096c5dfd4577ccd8a290234edae81b8f850d96/1750430926/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748980957","id":257149400,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149400/movie480.mp4?t=1748980957","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149400/movie_max.mp4?t=1748980957"},"name":"Echoes in the Dark_Trailer #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149400/130e34f8061769014107d0519999b8e056b01b68/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748980957","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149400/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1748980957","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257149400/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1748980957"}}],"name":"Echoes in the Dark","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 64-bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-2500 @3.3 GHz / AMD FX-8320 @3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 560 Ti / AMD Radeon\u2122 HD 6870 (1GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stro