atic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/480f57cf792251d26c1082f50d306b4e870d0b3a/ss_480f57cf792251d26c1082f50d306b4e870d0b3a.600x338.jpg?t=1754820049"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/771a4b20e708d7e54b9aec39da10accf6c2f3050/ss_771a4b20e708d7e54b9aec39da10accf6c2f3050.1920x1080.jpg?t=1754820049","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736440/771a4b20e708d7e54b9aec39da10accf6c2f3050/ss_771a4b20e708d7e54b9aec39da10accf6c2f3050.600x338.jpg?t=1754820049"}],"short_description":"A horror FPS where monsters only move when you do. As the officer on duty, you\u2019re dispatched to investigate an emergency call. But what awaits is an abandoned graveyard steeped in darkness and terror. Solve cryptic puzzles, uncover long-buried secrets, and fight to escape the cursed grounds.","steam_appid":3736440,"support_info":{"email":"demeter.martin@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}